WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.800
Hi everyone, this is the Samo Yoga channel, my name is Zorka, and today we're doing exercises to strengthen the arms.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:10.500
You don't need any extra equipment, we'll use our own body and gravity.

3
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.200
These exercises can be done from a seated or standing position.

4
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.100
Extend your arms to the sides and relax your shoulders back and down, away from your ears.

5
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.500
Open your palms to the sky, then point them toward the mat.

6
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:37.000
Open, squeeze, open, squeeze, open, squeeze.

7
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.400
This exercise stretches the forearms and wrists very well.

8
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:48.900
And it's wonderful for anyone doing exercises like plank and downward dog, because it strengthens the wrists.

9
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.200
Just keep going.

10
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:57.700
Palms up, down, up, down. And the last one.

11
00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:02.900
Hold your arms and now we make circles with the arms forward.

12
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:09.500
Five, four, three, two, one.

13
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:22.200
Change direction. Three, two, one.

14
00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:29.700
Let's return to the starting position. We send our arms in front of us, and then open.

15
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:33.000
Shoulders down, away from the ears.

16
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:39.500
We bring the palms together in front of us, open them to the sides.

17
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:50.600
Engage your belly, open, close, open, close.

18
00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.600
The movement comes from the shoulders. Once more.

19
00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.900
Keep your arms to the sides, bend them at the elbows and bring the elbows together in front of you.

20
00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.800
We work, the movement comes from the shoulders.

21
00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:11.200
Bring together, squeeze the elbows and shoulders at the back.

22
00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:23.200
Each time you open, chest forward, open, close, open, close, open, close.

23
00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:31.800
Keep breathing, two more, and hold your arms in front of you, we just move them up, down.

24
00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:40.800
Ten, nine, eight, seven, six, five, four, three, two, one.

25
00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:48.800
And slowly we can open the arms to the sides, repeat this movement. Close, open, close, open.

26
00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:55.400
Keep your elbows at a ninety-degree angle.

27
00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:04.400
Once more, open and extend the arms. We move the arms only up, down.

28
00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:12.500
Ten, nine, eight, seven, six, five, four, three, two, one.

29
00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:20.300
And another ten, nine, eight, seven, six, five, four, three, two and one.

30
00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:25.600
Wonderful. Hold your arms, send them in front of you, up, to the sides.

31
00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:33.200
Forward, up, to the sides. Forward, up, to the sides. Keep going.

32
00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:47.200
Arms extended, we send them forward, up, to the sides.

33
00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:58.100
You probably feel warmth in your arms already, keep breathing, we'll finish soon.

34
00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:05.300
Forward, up, to the sides. Two more times.

35
00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:15.500
Next time open your arms to the sides, pause in this position, take a deep breath in and a gentle breath out.

36
00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:40.400
We make circular movements forward. Ten, nine, eight, seven, six, five, four, three, two, one. Other direction, just keep going, five more, four, three, two, one. Keep your arms extended and just take them back.

37
00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:52.000
Here we go: ten, nine, eight, seven. Squeeze the shoulder blades on your back, three more, two, one.

38
00:04:52.000 --> 00:05:05.300
Excellent, keep your arms extended, open your palms to the sky, deep breath in, gentle breath out, once more, open the chest and on the exhale relax the arms.

39
00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:20.000
Slowly we can pull the right arm toward the left, stretching the shoulders. Relax the arms, other side.

40
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:30.400
Take a deep breath and slowly shake out the arms, relax the arms along the body.

41
00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.800
Thank you very much for joining me in this session.